/28/chefs-warehouse-inc-chef-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"CHEF 2021 Q2","e":"chef","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher Pappas","x":"…our decision that we need to keep the company together rather than just do tons and tons of more layoffs and try to crank up the numbers -- even though the numbers are good, I think the extra effort in offering service that customers are used to as much as possible, obviously, we're still short…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/chefs-warehouse-inc-chef-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"CHEF 2021 Q3","e":"chef","d":"2021-10-27","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"James Leddy","x":"We saw very limited incremental business in the segments of our markets that are -- do better when offices are full at theater districts, things like that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/chefs-warehouse-inc-chef-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"CHEF 2021 Q3","e":"chef","d":"2021-10-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"James Leddy","x":"The question was about our direct to consumer business so, Ben you're asking about Shop Like a Chef?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/chefs-warehouse-inc-chef-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"CHEF 2021 Q3","e":"chef","d":"2021-10-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Christopher Pappas","x":"So we've always had a strong direct to consumer business with our Allen Brothers consumer business, it's online, it's catalog.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/chefs-warehouse-inc-chef-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"CHEF 2021 Q3","e":"chef","d":"2021-10-27","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Ben Klieve","x":"Just one quick one from me on the direct to consumer business model here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/27/chefs-warehouse-inc-chef-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"CHEF 2021 Q3","e":"chef","d":"2021-10-27","l":"pricing_pow